WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone is about to start!

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:09.380
So we're going to fight to bring history back to the way it was.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.920
Yeah.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.850
But before we do that, I want a little more time.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.870
Time?

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.500
I'll go get the Artifact.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.820
You need it, don't you?

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:21.100
Also, there's something I want to do.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.430
Okay then. We'll leave tomorrow.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.790
Tsurugi.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.940
You shouldn't go.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.000
Kyousuke doesn't know who you are.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.630
Kyousuke.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:51.340
Nii-san.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:54.140
Could you come with me for a little while?

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:55.860
I want us to go to the riverbank.

00:00:56.150 --> 00:00:57.590
The riverbank?

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.540
Yeah.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.050
How about we play soccer together? It's been so long.

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.310
Sorry, Nii-san.

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:08.290
You'll have to go by yourself.

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:14.300
His feelings haven't changed...

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.890
Tsurugi.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:03:00.170
The thing you wanted to do was play soccer with Tsurugi?

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:00.920
Yeah.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.730
This is my last chance.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.140
Last chance?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:08.490
The "me" now who can play soccer has to disappear.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.840
I can't bend reality and steal soccer from Kyousuke.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.920
Yuuichi-san.

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:21.120
But before I lose my ability to play soccer, I wanted to play soccer with Kyousuke just once.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.060
Like how we did back then.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:28.560
But I guess just one time was too much to ask.

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.620
That's not true.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.480
I'm sure Tsurugi feels the same way.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.980
Thank you.

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.010
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:40.250
We're taking back the real Raimon soccer club.

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:51.240
Tsurugi!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:54.810
Who are you?

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.670
You really don't remember me.

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.290
I'm Yuuichi-san's junior.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.830
My brother's?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.170
The soccer club, huh.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:09.590
What do you want?

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.300
Why did you turn down Yuuichi-san's invitation?

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.440
What?

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.980
I was there too.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.420
It's none of your business.

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:22.140
Yuuichi-san is going to give soccer back to you...

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.650
Or, plans to...

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.440
No... never mind...

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:31.540
I don't know what it is you want to say, but I've given it up long ago.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.650
I'm fed up with it.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:37.150
The Tsurugi that I know would never be fed up with soccer.

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.120
What?

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:41.120
You want to play soccer, don't you? You love it!

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:45.930
You don't know anything about me!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.470
What would you know?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.160
I know-

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.430
Not playing soccer even though you love it makes no sense.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:56.510
I'm sure even soccer is waiting for you to come back.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.800
Get off my case!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:03.940
Quit it with your "soccer, soccer".

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:10.550
Here I go!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.910
Okay, bring it!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:29.570
You came!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.940
I don't know if I'll be that good.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.440
It's been forever.

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.120
You still remember it all.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:45.860
You still love soccer, don't you.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.410
Nii-san...

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:51.890
Care to spend a little bit of time playing soccer with me?

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:58.350
The last soccer between you and me.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:04.230
Well, if it's just this once.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:08.120
Thank you.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.770
Nothing less from you, Kyousuke.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:39.800
Thank goodness.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:40.690
Yeah.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:44.850
This is my...

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:48.880
No, our Artifact that links us two brothers.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:53.050
Kyousuke and I always played soccer with this ball when we were little.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.340
Okay.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:00.990
It's great that you got to play soccer with Tsurugi again.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:02.310
Yeah.

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.820
The Artifact is set.

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:10.300
The amplitude of its space-time waves is weakening.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.320
We won't be able to restore it if we don't hurry.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.430
Yeah...

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.330
Tenma, we have to leave now.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:22.480
Huh? Aren't we going to wait for the rest of the soccer club?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:27.330
If we don't time jump now, we might not be able to change back history.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:30.310
Okay.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.380
Are you ready?

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.600
Wormhole cycle confirmed!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.330
Beginning time route detection!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.100
Collating coordinate axes!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.890
T minus 5 seconds to time jump!

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:43.900
4...

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:44.900
3...

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:45.900
2...

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:46.900
1...

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.750
Time jump!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.030
Wow!

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:01.930
Are we in the past?

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:03.320
There's no mistake.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:03.770
Look.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.750
There's me and Kyousuke from six years ago.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.100
It really is Tsurugi-senpai.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.490
Wow... Wow!

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:15.370
We really have traveled through time!

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:15.940
Yeah!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:19.450
Are you really sure about this?

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:24.890
If we change history back to the way it was, you won't be able to walk anymore.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:30.310
If that is my true destiny, then I'll accept it.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:33.370
I accept it and I will conquer it.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:37.100
Besides, I have no regrets anymore.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.450
My wish has been granted.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.040
I was able to play soccer with him one more time.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.740
That's enough.

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:49.750
I'll return soccer to Kyousuke.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:52.380
Fire Tornado!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.110
Bakunetsu Screw!

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.060
They're here.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:10.510
Execute the command.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.160
Yes.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.880
I will now modify the Interruption point.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:18.590
Stop!

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:19.950
Don't touch them!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:23.950
We meet again.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.960
I understand.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.160
Is this the guy we're supposed to fight?

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.330
Yes.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:37.320
He's Alpha from Protocol Omega.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:40.850
Whoever interferes with us must be eliminated.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.310
Move Mode.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:54.590
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:59.560
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.010
Where are we?

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:07.320
We're inside Raimon's soccer building.

00:10:08.910 --> 00:10:11.560
The place where your soccer will be buried for good.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.300
It looks like they really do plan to settle this through soccer.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.930
We'll take whatever they throw at us.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:19.160
That's why we came here.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.820
They're wearing Raimon uniforms!

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.200
These are the Dupli that you mentioned, Tenma?

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:30.600
Honey!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:33.340
Yakisoba for two, and make it snappy!

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.860
Okay!

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:39.250
Oh, by the way, honey...

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:42.480
Huh? He disappeared again!

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.080
That makes this the third time today!

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.240
What's this?!

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.480
Another unexpected development!

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.820
I'm back again on soccer grounds in who-knows-where!

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:57.940
The Fei and Matsukaze Eleven!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:02.310
They were previously registered as Tenmas but this time they're Team Raimon!

00:11:02.770 --> 00:11:05.470
We've fought against them once before and won.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.670
This match is in our favor.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.560
Now, the match begins! Matsukaze moves into the offense!

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.150
Aggressive Beat!

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.100
He's fast!

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.520
When did he learn that technique?

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.120
Fei!

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.220
Shindou-kun!

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:33.630
I can't keep up...

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.590
Concentrate!

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:43.490
Tsurugi-senpai!

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:45.460
Tenma-kun!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.130
Medam clears Matsukaze's shoot!

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.430
Raimon does not score!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:04.510
The forward Alpha moves back to defense!

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:11.440
Demon Soldier Pendragon!

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:13.040
Armed!

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:24.140
Ruler of the Skies, Phoenix!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:27.910
Armed!

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.930
They're wearing their Avatars!

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:43.600
That's possible?!

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.440
Weak.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.920
Alpha blocks Tsurugi Yuuichi's charge!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.250
Raimon's offense is pushed back again!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.890
Are you okay?

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.140
Yeah.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:07.160
We must win this game no matter what.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.380
We won't let them change history.

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:10.600
Okay!

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:13.800
Raimon attacks!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:18.400
But Protocol Omega's tight defense keeps them from scoring!

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.090
So that's it!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.010
The first half ends here!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:29.070
Just as you ordered, we are putting all of our manpower into defense.

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.720
Keep it up.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.500
They've completely blocked off our offense.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:39.000
It looks like they've been inputted with the data gathered from our matches against them in the parallel worlds.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:42.000
How about putting more of our people into offense?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:48.540
No, if we loosen up our defense, they'll jump right in and attack there.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.700
Let's keep attacking as we are now.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:54.820
I'll steal a goal no matter what.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:56.560
Okay!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:14:00.210
The second half begins!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.030
Raimon charges in!

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:09.610
Shindou-senpai!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.300
There!

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:15.520
Whoa! Shindou makes an exquisite pass!

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.040
Yuuichi-san, are you hurt?

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:27.960
I'm okay.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.760
We have to do whatever it takes to take a point from them.

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.640
There is a way.

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:38.450
I took Tsurugi Kyousuke's aura, just in case.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.230
I can fuse it with Yuuichi-kun.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:43.890
Since they're brothers, their compatibility will be unmatched!

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:46.650
But he quit soccer, didn't he?

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.290
Will the real Kyousuke's power come out?

00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:51.090
That... I don't know!

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.020
But there's still a possibility!

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:01.190
I believe in his feelings for soccer.

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:02.410
Tenma-kun...

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:05.670
Okay.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.540
Let's try it.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:09.740
I'll watch for the appropriate time and tell you when.

00:15:09.740 --> 00:15:10.540
Yes, sir!

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:14.050
Now, only a few minutes remain!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.470
It's time to finish this.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:17.410
Roger.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.860
Ruler of the Skies, Phoenix!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.710
Armed!

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:39.970
We won't let it end here!

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.900
Full Throttle Jump!

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.020
Excellent Breast!

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:03.100
Machos blocks it!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:07.130
Raimon blocks Alpha's shoot with their full-bodied defense!

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:08.370
Why?

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:09.780
Over here!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.070
Machos!

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.420
Okay!

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.960
There's not much time left!

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.910
Yuuichi-kun!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:25.640
Let's do it!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.930
Mixi-max!

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.990
Kyousuke, let's go!

00:16:56.180 --> 00:16:57.160
Kyousuke...

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.450
I've decided to give soccer back to you.

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.350
What are you talking about?

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.540
Nothing.

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:08.580
I just want you to keep loving soccer, always.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:10.740
Kyousuke!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.510
Make a shoot!

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:28.460
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.860
Armed!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:44.060
Tenma can wear his Avatar too?!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.240
Yuuichi-san!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:49.420
This is your last chance!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.290
Let's make it in, Kyousuke!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.270
Death Drop!

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:03.500
Keeper Command 03!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:04.810
<Boom Shout>

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:09.010
Goal!

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:12.440
Tsurugi Yuuichi's Death Drop goes in!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:19.230
The match is over! Raimon wins!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.160
Kyousuke...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.180
Thank you.

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.920
We have lost...

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:27.220
An inconceivable result.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:31.890
Yes.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.790
We are retreating.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:34.570
Yes, sir.

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:44.090
What is this?

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:48.100
This aching feeling that prickles deep in my heart like thorns...

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.350
Move Mode.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:54.970
Mission accomplished.

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:57.510
Does this mean history has changed?

00:18:57.510 --> 00:18:58.510
Yeah.

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:01.930
The real Raimon soccer club should be back now.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:06.570
The real Raimon soccer club, huh...

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:10.140
Tenma-kun.

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:12.710
My job here is done.

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.760
Yuuichi-san...

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.870
What's happening?

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:25.160
The Interruption point has been modified back to its correct timeline.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:30.180
He is vanishing along with the timeline that he is from.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.190
I guess it's time.

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:39.440
Thank you.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.650
Let's go back.

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:52.040
The Tsurugi-kun that you know should be waiting for you.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:54.800
Okay.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.310
No way!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:11.370
Oh, you're here.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.120
Tsurugi!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:16.910
Ow...

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.690
What are you doing?

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:22.430
No, I'm just glad you're here.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.840
It's the soccer club.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.330
Of course I'm here.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.150
Yeah!

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:39.010
Um, hey!

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:41.100
How is Yuuichi-san doing?

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:44.530
Oh, he's recovering well.

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:46.230
His rehab is going great.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.900
I see...

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:55.660
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:08.210
Bad news, everyone!

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:09.950
Something terrible has happened!

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:12.140
Principal Hirai...

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:13.410
What's wrong?

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:17.880
The government has passed a bill through the National Diet declaring a soccer ban!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.940
A soccer ban?

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:20.880
That's right.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:25.390
It is now illegal to play soccer!

00:22:53.950 --> 00:22:57.420
The history of a friendly game between Japan and America has been changed?!

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:00.830
The Raimon Eleven tackle the enemy's newest strategy!

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:03.910
Next, Dismay! Soccer Is Banned!!

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:06.220
